icle><article class=\"tabber__panel\" role=\"tabpanel\" tabindex=\"0\" id=\"tabber-Filhote\" aria-labelledby=\"tabber-Filhote-label\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Raccoon-pup.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/f/f8/Raccoon-pup.png/130px-Raccoon-pup.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"130\" height=\"130\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/f/f8/Raccoon-pup.png/195px-Raccoon-pup.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/f/f8/Raccoon-pup.png/260px-Raccoon-pup.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p></article></section></div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#5E462A\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"#EAD3B3\"><b>Saúde</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td><b>Saúde (Macho/Fêmea)</b>\n</td>\n<td>6\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Saúde (Filhote)</b>\n</td>\n<td>5\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#5E462A\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"#EAD3B3\"><b>Ataque</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td><b>Ataque Base (Macho/Fêmea)</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#5E462A\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"#EAD3B3\"><b>Comportamento</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td><b>Alcance de alerta (m) (Macho/Fêmea)</b>\n</td>\n<td>20\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#5E462A\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"#EAD3B3\"><b> Multiplicar</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<tr>\n<td><b>Tempo de crescimento (dias)</b>\n</td>\n<td>14\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Gotas</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Bushmeat\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Bushmeat\">Carne de caça</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Bushmeat\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bushmeat\"> </a></span></b>\n</td>\n<td>1 - 3<abbr title=\"2,5 significa 2 + 50% de chance\">*</abbr>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Raw_hide\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Raw hide\">Pele crua pequena</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Raw_hide\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Raw hide\"> </a></span></b>\n</td>\n<td>1.25<abbr title=\"2,5 significa 2 + 50% de chance\">*</abbr>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Fat\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Fat\">Gordo</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Fat\" title=\"Fat\"> </a></span></b>\n</td>\n<td>0.25<abbr title=\"2,5 significa 2 + 50% de chance\">*</abbr>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Bone\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Bone\">Osso</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Bone\" title=\"Bone\"> </a></span></b>\n</td>\n<td>0.7<abbr title=\"2,5 significa 2 + 50% de chance\">*</abbr>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Bone\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Bone\">Osso</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Bone\" title=\"Bone\"> </a></span></b>\n</td>\n<td>0.7<abbr title=\"2,5 significa 2 + 50% de chance\">*</abbr>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Bone\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Bone\">Osso</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Bone\" title=\"Bone\"> </a></span></b>\n</td>\n<td>0.7<abbr title=\"2,5 significa 2 + 50% de chance\">*</abbr>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#5E462A\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"Bloba\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px; border-bottom-right-radius:7px; border-bottom-left-radius:7px;\"><a href=\"/Animals\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Animals\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Animais</b></font></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p><p><b>Raccoons</b> são animais comuns em florestas e pastagens arbustivas.\n</p><p><span id=\"Spawning\"></span>\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Desova\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Desova</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Comportamentos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Comportamentos</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Atacando_o_jogador\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Atacando o jogador</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Recebendo_dano\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Recebendo dano</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Domesticação\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Domesticação</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Colheita\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Colheita</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Histórico\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Histórico</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Observações\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Observações</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Galeria\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Galeria</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Veja_também\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Veja também</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Referências\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Referências</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Desova\">Desova</span></h2>\n<p>Os guaxinins desovam em grupos médios de 1-3 indivíduos, machos, fêmeas e filhotes. \n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-translate-fuzzy\">\n<p>Guaxinins desovam no seguinte clima:\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Parâmetro</th>\n<th>Min. valor</th>\n<th>Máx. valor\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Temperature\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Temperature\">Temperatura</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Temperature\" title=\"Temperature\"> </a></span></td>\n<td>-4</td>\n<td>15\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Weather\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Weather\">Chuva</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Weather\" title=\"Weather\"> </a></span></td>\n<td>0.4</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Floresta</td>\n<td>0.5</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Arbustos</td>\n<td>0.5</td>\n<td>1\n</td></tr>\n\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p><span id=\"Behaviors\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Comportamentos\">Comportamentos</span></h2>\n<p>Os guaxinins procuram comer frutas vermelhas de todos os tipos de arbustos e mel de skeps, ou depositados no chão como itens. Eles não podem pular cercas ou sair de buracos com 2 quarteirões de profundidade. Filhotes de guaxinim tentam ficar perto de guaxinins fêmeas e não atacam.\n</p><p><span id=\"Attacking&#95;the&#95;Player\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Atacando_o_jogador\">Atacando o jogador</span></h3>\n<p>Os guaxinins só atacarão quando estiverem danificados e procurarão o jogador a até 20 quarteirões de distância. Guaxinins têm um ataque corpo a corpo que causa 3 de dano. Os guaxinins não tentam evitar obstáculos ao perseguir o jogador e cairão facilmente em buracos.\n</p><p><span id=\"Receiving&#95;damage\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Recebendo_dano\">Recebendo dano</span></h3>\n<p>Ocasionalmente, os guaxinins fogem ou atacam ao sofrer danos.\n</p><p><span id=\"Domestication\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Domestica.C3.A7.C3.A3o\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Domesticação\">Domesticação</span></h2>\n<p>Os guaxinins não podem ser domesticados, mas podem ser mortos para obter recursos animais. \n</p><p><span id=\"Harvesting\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Colheita\">Colheita</span></h2>\n<p>Os jogadores podem abater um guaxinim usando um <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Knife\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Knife\">faca</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Knife\" title=\"Knife\"> </a></span> para obter itens. <abbr title=\"Esgueirar-se, o padrão é shift e clicar com o botão direito\">Shift+clique com o botão direito</abbr> até que o processo de açougue seja concluído e a GUI seja aberta para permitir que os jogadores removam os itens descartados. \n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Hist.C3.B3rico\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Histórico\">Histórico</span></h2>\n<h2><span id=\"Observa.C3.A7.C3.B5es\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Observações\">Observações</span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Galeria\">Galeria</span></h2>\n<h2><span id=\"Veja_tamb.C3.A9m\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Veja_também\">Veja também</span></h2>\n<h2><span id=\"Refer.C3.AAncias\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Referências\">Referências</span></h2>\n<div style=\"margin: auto; padding: 4px; border-color: #382b1e; border-width: 3px; border-style: solid; margin: auto; width: 90%; border-radius: 4px; background-color: #e0cfbb;\">\n<table class=\"mw-collapsible\" style=\"border-spacing: 2px; width: 100%;\">\n  <tbody><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background: rgb(91,76,62); background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(91,76,62,0) 5px, rgba(56,43,30,0) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%), linear-gradient(to right, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 5px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 50%, rgba(69,52,36,1) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%);\">\n    <big><b><span style=\"color: #e0cfbb\">Entidades</span></b></big></th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"height: 30px; text-align: center; width: 10%; background: #5B4C3E; color:#e0cfbb;\"><b>Passivo</b></td>\n    <td style=\"background: #e0cfbb;\"><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Butterfly\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Butterfly\">Borboleta</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Butterfly\" title=\"Butterfly\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Deer\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Deer\">Veado</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Deer\" title=\"Deer\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Gazelle\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Gazelle\">Gazela</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Gazelle\" title=\"Gazelle\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Goat\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Goat\">Cabra</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Goat\" title=\"Goat\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Hare\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Hare\">Lebre</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Hare\" title=\"Hare\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Salmon\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Salmon\">Salmão</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Salmon\" title=\"Salmon\"> </a></span></td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td style=\"height: 30px; text-align: center; width: 10%; background: #5B4C3E; color:#e0cfbb;\"><b>Neutra</b></td>\n    <td style=\"background: #CCBCAB;\"><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Bees\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Bees\">Abelhas</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Bees\" title=\"Bees\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Bighorn_sheep\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Bighorn sheep\">Carneiro selvagem</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Bighorn_sheep\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bighorn sheep\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Chicken\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Chicken\">Gali